s the vast potential of emerging technologies and the need for strategic al=
ignment in an AI-powered future. For executives, success will hinge on iden=
tifying high-impact domains in which they can apply these trends, investing=
 in the necessary talent and infrastructure, and addressing external factor=
s like regulatory shifts and ecosystem readiness. By fostering collaboratio=
n, bridging ecosystem gaps, and maintaining a long-term vision, leaders can=
